Q3: In one sentence, what does dBFS mean? Do not use any tools.
---
dBFS stands for decibels relative to full scale, a logarithmic unit used to express signal power levels in digital systems where the maximum possible amplitude (full scale) is defined as 0 dB.<|im_end|>
